  "worked_solution": "The universal quantifier \"$\u2200$\" means \"for all.\" So, our quantified statement reads as follows:\n\n$\\,$ **For all** $m\\in N,$ $m$ is an odd number.\n\nThis can be further simplified as follows:\n\n$\\,$ Every natural number is odd.\n\n**Note:** This statement is false.",
